# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]
### Added
- Sample data: `examples/sample-vcenter-inventory.csv`, `examples/sample-backup-inventory.csv`, and `examples/sample-results.(csv|json)` (synthetic 5–10 row examples).
- Compact Stage-0 vs Stage-1 vs Stage-2 comparison table in docs.

### Changed
- JSON-LD schema updated to explicitly link **Stage-0** with **VMware migration assessment**.
- Canonical explainer moved to `/vmware-migration-readiness/stage-0`.

### Notes
- Remember to update the website’s visible **“Updated on”** date and the JSON-LD `dateModified` when publishing any of the above.

## [1.0.0] - 2025-09-02
### Added
- Initial release of the **VMware Migration Readiness (Google Sheets) tool**:
  - Inputs: vCenter inventory CSV + backup inventory CSV (documented headers).
  - Outputs: per-VM readiness bands (Red/Yellow/Green) with reasons, plus exec-ready rollups.
  - Privacy: runs locally in your Google Drive (no external uploads).
  - Also available as an offline `.xlsx` workbook.

